OL,3,GNEWSAApproval for up to 3,800 homes on
OL,4,Aoutskirts of city
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build almost 4,000 new homes
OL,7,Fon the outskirts of Cambridge have been
OL,8,Fapproved by two councils.
OL,10,FA joint committee of councillors from
OL,11,FCambridge City Council and South
OL,12,FCambridgeshire District Council agreed
OL,13,Fto proposals for up to 3,800 more homes
OL,14,Fas part of the next phase of the
OL,15,FUniversity of Cambridge's Eddington
OL,16,Fdevelopment.
OL,18,FThe development could also create more
OL,19,Fthan 4,000 jobs, according to a report
OL,20,Fprepared by planning officers.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
