OL,3,GNEWSAApproval for up to 3,800 homes on
OL,4,Aoutskirts of city
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreater Cambridge Shared Planning
OL,7,FService approved plans at a meeting on
OL,8,FWednesday, subject to a Section 106
OL,9,Fagreement, which means its developer
OL,10,Fwould have to help finance local
OL,11,Fservices such as a library and bin
OL,12,Fcollections.
